    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:7f980bc15cffb6eb7a929ccf13ee4bbc1999c21eaaa12a11e65e3f27462d6a99",
    "task": "(In the clubroom…)\n\nMonika: “Um…where’s Sayori? Last time she was here, she had a baby bump so big she looked like she was about to pop.”\n\nYuri: (nervously fidgets with her book) “I…I’m not sure, Monika. I haven’t seen her since yesterday. Wasn’t she supposed to be here for the club meeting?”\n\nNatsuki: (crosses her arms and huffs) “Knowing her, she probably forgot again. This is just like her to bail on us.”\n\nSayori: (enters the clubroom with a hand on her belly) “Hey guys, sorry I’m late! I overslept. Pregnancy can be tiring…and this is just my 7th month.”",
    "chosen": "Sayori: (glowing with joy as she gently pats her belly) \"I apologize for causing you concern! Experiencing pregnancy feels like embarking on a brand new journey each day.\"\n\nMonika: (rushing over to help Sayori to a chair) \"We completely understand! Just make sure to take care of yourself. Have you been getting enough rest?\"\n\nYuri: (setting her book aside, her nervousness replaced with genuine concern) \"I... I've been reading about pregnancy wellness... if you'd like, I could share some calming tea recipes that are safe for expecting mothers.\"\n\nNatsuki: (her previous annoyance melting into a playful grin) \"Hmph, you better not forget about the baby shower I'm planning. Nobody makes better cupcakes for special occasions than me!\"\n\nSayori: (tears of happiness welling up) \"You all are so considerate! I’m excited to embark on this journey with my beloved friends. The baby is fortunate to have such wonderful aunties!\"",
    "rejected": "Sayori: (smiling) “I’m so glad you’re here, everyone! I’m so happy to see you all. I’m so excited to tell you all about my pregnancy!”\n\nMonika: (smiling back) “I’m so happy for you, Sayori! I’m so proud of you!”\n\nYuri: (smiling) “I’m so happy for you, Sayori! I’m so excited to see you all!”\n\nNatsuki: (smiling) “I’m so happy for you, Sayori! I’m so proud of you!”\n\nSayori: (smiling) “Thank you so much, everyone! I’m so excited to meet you all and tell you all about my pregnancy. I’m so happy to be here with you all!”\n\nMonika: \"Sayori, how are you feeling? You look like you're about to pop!\"\n\nSayori: (laughs) \"I know, right? I feel like I'm carrying a watermelon around!\"\n\nYuri: (giggling) \"It's amazing how much your body can change during pregnancy.\"\n\nNatsuki: \"Yeah, but you're still as cute as ever, Sayori!\"\n\nSayori: (blushing) \"Aww, thanks Natsuki!\"\n\nMonika: \"Have you started preparing for the baby's arrival?\"\n\nSayori: \"Yes! I've been nesting like crazy. The nursery is almost ready, and I've been reading up on all the baby books.\"\n\nYuri: \"That's wonderful! Have you picked out a name yet?\"\n\nSayori: \"Not yet. I have a few ideas, but I want to wait until I meet the baby to decide.\"\n\nNatsuki: \"Well, whatever you choose, I'm sure it will be perfect.\"\n\nSayori: \"Thanks, Natsuki. I'm just so excited to meet my little one!\"\n\nMonika: \"We're all excited for you, Sayori. You're going to be an amazing mom!\"\n\nSayori: (tears welling up) \"Thank you, Monika. That means a lot to me.\"\n\nYuri: \"We're here for you, Sayori. If you need anything, just let us know.\"\n\nSayori: \"I will. Thank you all for being here with me. It means the world to me.\"\n\n(The girls all hug Sayori, showing their love and support for their friend.)",
